		{
			"statement": "Trace la droite qui passe par les points ${{if:k==3|B|A}}$ et ${{if:k==1|B|C}}$.\n\n```figure-a-completer\nfenetre: 0 ; 10 ; 0 ; 6\noutils: droite\nverifier: droite_par {{if:k==3|B|A}} ; {{if:k==1|B|C}}\n---\nA = point({{xa}}, {{ya}})\nB = point({{xb}}, {{yb}})\nC = point({{xc}}, {{yc}})\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "1..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "x1",
					"expression": "1..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "x2",
